# ---- Vendored upstream data ----
# tau2 benchmark data, fetched by scripts/bootstrap_data.py. Large (~140M) and
# pinned to the tau2 rev in pyproject.toml, so it is reproducible, not tracked.
vendor/

# ---- Benchmark results ----
# Raw tau2 simulation output is bulky and reproducible; the written-up report
# is not, so it is tracked.
results/*
!results/reports.md
